		<r3d:repositoryName language="eng">Bugwood Image Database System</r3d:repositoryName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://images.bugwood.org/</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">bugwood.org is the host website of the Center for Invasive Species and Ecosystem Health at the University of Georgia  (Formerly: Bugwood Network). The Center aims to develop, consolidate and disseminate information and programmes focused on invasive species, forest health, natural resources and agricultural management through technology development, programmes implementation, training, applied research and public awareness at state, regional, national and international levels. The site gives details of its products (Bugwood Image Database; Early Detection and Distribution Mapping and Bugwoodwiki). Details of its projects, services and personnel are provided. Users can also access image databases on Forestry, Insects, IPM, Invasive Species, Forest Pests, weed and Bark Beetle.</r3d:description>
